{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"version"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLDocument","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument\/Version","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Version","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV7VersionV"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The version attribute was added in Version 1.1 for the score-partwise and score-timewise documents. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provides an easier way to get version information than through the MusicXML public ID. The default value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"1.0 to make it possible for programs that handle later versions to distinguish earlier version files reliably."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Programs that write MusicXML 1.1 or later files should set this attribute."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"version"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV","text":"MXLDocument"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Version","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV7VersionV"}],"title":"version","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLOpusV7versionAA11MXLDocumentV7VersionVvp","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/version"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/version"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The document-attributes attribute group is used to specify the attributes for an entire MusicXML document.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Currently this is used for the version attribute.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus/version":{"abstract":[{"text":"The document-attributes attribute group is used to specify the attributes for an entire MusicXML document.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Currently this is used for the version attribute.","type":"text"}],"title":"version","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLDocument","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Version","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV7VersionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/version","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/version"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDocument/Version":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument\/Version","title":"MXLDocument.Version","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Version","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Version","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldocument\/version","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML version number.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDocument":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDocument"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A top-level document parsed from a MusicXML file."}],"title":"MXLDocument","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldocument","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDocument"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLOpus"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The opus type is used for the root element of a MusicXML opus. Each opus is made up of a series of score,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opus-link, and\/or nested opus elements. The document-attributes attribute group includes the version","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute. Future versions may include more metadata elements. In this version, we just include the title of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the opus.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLOpus","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLOpus"}],"role":"symbol"}}}